        "CQ_S0_R1_0191"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0198"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0212"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0223"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0233"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceChunk "1806.01619_rag::chunk_002"^^xsd:string,
        "1806.01619_rag::chunk_003"^^xsd:string,
        "4522-practical-bayesian-optimization-of-machine-learning-algorithms_rag::chunk_003"^^xsd:string,
        "8194-maximizing-acquisition-functions-for-bayesian-optimization_rag::chunk_000"^^xsd:string,
        "8194-maximizing-acquisition-functions-for-bayesian-optimization_rag::chunk_003"^^xsd:string,
        "autoweka_rag::chunk_003"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceText "Acquisition function suggests next evaluation by maximization"^^xsd:string,
        "Bayesian optimization is a sample-efcient approach to global optimization that relies on theoretically motivated value heuristics (acquisition functions) to guide its search process."^^xsd:string,
        "SMBO uses a so-called acquisition function a M L : R , which uses the predictive distribution of model M L at arbitrary hyperparameter congurations to quantify (in closed form) how useful knowledge about would be."^^xsd:string,
        "There are several popular choices of acquisition function."^^xsd:string,
        "There are several popular choices of acquisition function. Under the Gaussian process prior, these functions depend on the model solely through its predictive mean function"^^xsd:string,
        "Under the Gaussian process prior, these functions depend on the model solely through its predictive mean function ( x ; { x n , y n } , ) and predictive variance function 2 ( x ; { x n , y n } , ) ."^^xsd:string,
        "acquisition function L ) yields concrete actions (e.g. decisions regarding sets of queries X )"^^xsd:string,
        "acquisition function that suggests the next most interesting point x i +1 that should be evaluated."^^xsd:string,
        "theoretically motivated value heuristics (acquisition functions) to guide its search process."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :method,
        owl:Thing ;
    skos:altLabel "Acquisition Function"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:skos_definition "A function used by SMBO to quantify how useful knowledge about a hyperparameter configuration would be, typically by trading off exploitation and exploration."^^xsd:string ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom "CQ_S0_R1_0017"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0052"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0077"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0103"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0158"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0179"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0191"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0198"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0212"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0223"^^xsd:string,
        "CQ_S0_R1_0233"^^xsd:string .

