    kg:textSpan "number of variables are presented rst. For a small dataset like this one, AutoCompete selects a few fast models and then optimizes the hyper-parameters for the model with highest area under the ROC curve. AUC is chosen as the evaluation metric since the labels are skewed and a threshold on predicted probabilities will be more intuitive than classication accuracy. Figure 3 shows the models which were evaluated and their performance on the Adult dataset. The selected model with a grid based hyper-" .

