    kg:docId "1601.07925_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/1601_07925_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "through the pipeline. Each step in this diagram corresponds to a pipeline operator in the nal TPOT pipeline. Starting from the raw data set, the pipeline applies a series of three feature construction steps (a random forest feature constructor, a decision tree feature constructor, then another random forest feature constructor), adding a new synthetic feature to the data set each time before proceeding to the next step. At the nal classication step, the random forest classier has access to a dat" .

