    kg:textSpan ", 10 , 19 , 12 ]. We show empirically that the autonomous optimization algorithm we learn converges faster and/or nds better optima than existing hand-engineered optimization algorithms. 2 Related Work Early work has explored the general theme of speeding up learning with accumulation of learning experience. This line of work, known as learning to learn or meta-learning [ 1 , 27 , 5 , 26 ], considers the problem of devising methods that can take advantage of knowledge learned on other related ta" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/1606_01885_rag__chunk_003> a kg:Chunk ;
