    kg:textSpan "each dataset, we have a separate held-out validation dataset to compute the reward signal. The reported performance on the test set is computed only once for the network that achieves the best result on the held-out validation dataset. More details about our experimental procedures and results are as follows. 4.1 L EARNING C ONVOLUTIONAL A RCHITECTURES FOR CIFAR-10 Dataset: In these experiments we use the CIFAR-10 dataset with data preprocessing and augmentation procedures that are in line with " .

