        "autoweka_rag::chunk_012"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceText "Bayesian optimization (BO) is a model-based approach for gradient-free black-box function optimization, such as hyperparameter optimization."^^xsd:string,
        "Bayesian optimization (BO) is a successful methodology to optimize black-box functions that are expensive to evaluate."^^xsd:string,
        "Gradient-based algorithms are not a prevalent choice for hyper-parameter optimization"^^xsd:string,
        "grid search is the most commonly-used form of hyperparameter optimization"^^xsd:string,
        "hyperparameter optimization as an algorithmic approach for nding optimal values of architecture independent hyperparameters"^^xsd:string,
        "hyperparameter_scale_min_max_learning_parameters_initial_learning_rate_log_5_10_5_5_conv1_l_2_penalty"^^xsd:string,
        "hyperparameters are values that control the model conguration or the training setup and thus need to be set before training the model."^^xsd:string,
        "search this space to optimize 10-fold cross-validation performance"^^xsd:string,
        "selecting the best-performing hyperparameter combination."^^xsd:string,
        "techniques for the automatic optimization of hyper-parameters"^^xsd:string,
        "uses Bayesian Optimization (Sequential model-based optimization) to search for optimal hyperparameter settings of the pipeline."^^xsd:string,
        "warmstarting optimization by meta-learning has already been successfully applied before [ 4 , 5 , 6 ], but never to an optimization problem as complex as that of searching the space of instantiations of a full-edged ML framework."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :entity,
        owl:Thing ;
    skos:altLabel "Hyper-parameter Optimization"^^xsd:string,
        "HyperParameterOptimization"^^xsd:string,
        "Hyperparameter Optimization"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:skos_definition "A methodology to optimize black-box functions that are expensive to evaluate, often involving the selection of hyperparameter combinations from a search space."^^xsd:string ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom "CQ_S0_R1_0002"^^xsd:string,
