    kg:textSpan "for fast and accurate inference. AMC [ 56 ] utilizes AutoML techniques to replace manual efforts in achieving automatic compression of models with high compression rate. In the disciplines of earth and environmental sciences, AutoML has demonstrated its efficacy in characterizing unconventional reservoirs, accurately predicting key properties like shale volume, porosity, and bitumen content [ 99 ]. Moreover, in the field of materials science, AutoML is applied in predicting the properties of con" .

