        "are also used in the AutoML system H YPEROPT SKLEARN"^^xsd:string,
        "automl-streams, the experimental framework proposed in this work"^^xsd:string,
        "empirical success when compared to other AutoML systems. However, by stacking models on top of each other, our search space is much larger than that of single-model AutoML systems such as TPOT or AutoSklearn."^^xsd:string,
        "most comparisons of AutoML systems focus on quantitative criteria such as"^^xsd:string ;
