    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/1601_07925_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "with only 200 records to train on. Even at the more dicult heritability setting of 0.1with a large amount of noise in the data setTPOT achieved > 65% testing accuracy with only 800 records for training. However, at data set sizes of < =200 records and 0.1 heritability, the pipelines discovered by TPOT didnt perform much better than chance (i.e., 50% testing accuracy due to the balanced classes). Generally, this array of tests demonstrated that TPOT performs best when provided with a) larger data" .

