    :hasEvidenceText "AutoML aims to fully automate the machine learning process end-to-end, democratizing Machine Learning to non-experts"^^xsd:string,
        "AutoML aims to fully automate the machine learning process end-to-end, democratizing Machine Learning to non-experts and drastically increasing the productivity of expert analysts."^^xsd:string,
        "AutoML research has focused on combining two tasks: machine learning pipeline building and intelligent model hyperparameter search."^^xsd:string,
        "AutoML targets at addressing complex design choices and high human labor cost in classical machine learning."^^xsd:string,
        "AutoML targets at addressing complex design choices and high human labor cost in classical machine learning. Through the process of atomization of learning configurations"^^xsd:string,
        "AutoML throughout the paper it means solving the combined algorithm selection and hyperparameter optimization problem, or CASH for short"^^xsd:string,
        "Automated Machine Learning (AutoML) is a rapidly rising subfield of Machine Learning. AutoML aims to fully automate the machine learning process end-to-end"^^xsd:string,
        "attempts to atomize (all or a part of) learning configurations and then recombine them through optimizing performance measure"^^xsd:string,
        "current AutoML solutions generate vast and rich information that can be useful for a number of purposes."^^xsd:string,
        "our search space is much larger than that of single-model AutoML systems such as TPOT or AutoSklearn."^^xsd:string,
        "systems for automating DNN configuration have been developed, such as Google AutoML"^^xsd:string,
        "when talking about AutoML throughout the paper it means solving the combined algorithm selection and hyperparameter optimization problem, or CASH for short"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :machine_learning,
        owl:Thing ;
    skos:skos_definition "A process that targets addressing complex design choices and high human labor cost in classical machine learning by atomizing and recombining learning configurations."^^xsd:string ;
