    kg:textSpan "[64] is another AutoML framework which is based on Scikit-learn machine learning library. Hyperopt-Sklearn uses Hyperopt [11] to dene the search space over the possible Scikit-Learn main components including the learning and preprocessing algorithms. Hyperpot supports dierent optimization techniques including random search, and dierent Bayesian optimizations for exploring the search spaces which are characterized by dierent types of variables including categorical, ordinal and continuous. 5.1 Ce" .

