    kg:textSpan "resources. The experiment searched for 128 congurations with up to 64 AWS EC2 instances. Because training time varies due to the changing model complexity (i.e. number of lters and neurons), we xed the random seed, such that all experiments explored the same congurations. On average, each job ran 5 minutes on a t2.medium instance with 4 vCPUs. Clearly, the training time dominates the runtime, whereas the communication and the HPO algorithm (random) take marginal time in total. The break from lin" .

