    kg:textSpan "and updating a population as each generation; each individual in every generation is then evaluated until the global optimum is identied [14]. The main dierences between dierent POAs are the methods used to generate and select populations [17]. POAs can be easily parallelized since a population of N individuals can be evaluated on at most N threads or 31 machines in parallel [6]. Genetic algorithms and particle swarm optimization are the two main POAs that are popularly-used for HPO problems. 4." .

