    kg:textSpan "an efcient post-processing method (which can be run in a second process on-the-y) to construct an ensemble out of them. This automatic ensemble construction avoids to commit itself to a single hyperparameter setting and is thus more robust (and less prone to overtting) than using the point estimate that standard hyperparameter optimization yields. To our best knowledge, we are the rst to make this simple observation, which can be applied to improve any Bayesian hyperparameter optimization method" .

