    kg:textSpan "of components and hyperparameters. An automated pipeline construction system, like a human expert, first forms a surrogate model to predict which pipelines are likely to work well. Surrogate models are meta-models that map dataset and machine learning model properties to quantities that characterize performance or informativeness. A good surrogate model enables efficient search through the pipeline space. All models are wrong, but some are useful [ 2 ]: a good surrogate model makes predictions t" .

